# Frontend (React)

## Stack

- React + TypeScript (Vite recommended).
- German UI labels; English code.

## Pages (MVP)

1. **Review** — scrollable list of last 100 detections (up to 1000 archived); thumbnail, class, confidence, timestamp; full image with **bbox overlay**.
2. **Spray settings** — delay (ms), duration (ms), speed, camera–nozzle distance; test mode toggle.
3. **Training** — select learning session, video frame scrubber, draw rectangle, assign class, save annotation.

## API

- REST only; axios or fetch to FastAPI backend.
- Auth hook ready but disabled when `auth_enabled` false (dev banner in UI).

## UX

- Show tank level + test mode + spray blocked reasons clearly.
- No spray controls in UI that bypass core safety (settings only).
